          "template": null,
          "documentation": "/** Panel-local note: Write a startup marker before waiting. slow_step(\"probe\", 25) returns { label: \"probe\", duration_ms: 25 }.\n * Marker: /var/tmp/soroi-e2e/markers/probe contains {\"label\":\"probe\",\"duration_ms\":25} plus a newline.\n * Labels are single safe path components; duration is a finite nonnegative number of milliseconds.\n */",
